# text = Glorie au Marquis de Carabas A few days after the dinner at Mr . Grey's , as the Marquess of Carabas was sitting in his library , and sighing , in the fulness of his ennui , as he looked on his large library table , once triply covered with official communications , now thinly besprinkled with a stray parliamentary paper or two , his steward's accounts , and a few letters from some grumbling tenants , Mr . Vivian Grey was announced The Peer's eyes glistened , and his companion proceeded ejaculated the Marquess said Vivian , rising Splendid peroration carelessly remarked Vivian and his Lordship rose , and rang the library bell with vehemence
