# text = He had arrived late at the Chateau the preceding night , and , although he had the honour of presenting his letter of introduction to the Marquess , this morning was the first time he had been seen by any of the party present , who were of course profoundly ignorant of his character said Mr . Mackaw said Vivian , rising , and taking a volume from the book-case Mr . Mackaw was restless the whole time that Vivian was reading this interesting passage .
