# text = French silks and French clocks rivalled Manchester cottons and Sheffield cutlery , and assisted to attract or entrap the gazer , in company with Venetian chains , Neapolitan coral , and Vienna pipe-heads : here was the booth of a great book-seller , who looked to the approaching Leipsic fair for some consolation for his slow sale and the bad taste of the people of Frankfort ; and there was a dealer in Bologna sausages , who felt quite convinced that in some things the taste of the Frankfort public was by no means to be lightly spoken of .
