# text = Pushing his plate briskly from him , he demanded with an anxious air said the Baron , with a mournful look said the Chevalier de Boeffleurs , shaking his head said the Baron continued the Baron and here the representative of a first-rate German Power looked very much like a resigned patriot , who feels that he deserves a ribbon echoed the French Charge d'Affaires asked the Austrian said the Baron said the Count , very indignantly commenced the Polish Prince quickly retorted the Baron , who was in no humour for a story continued the Prince but just at this moment the door opened , and Ernstorff entered and handed a despatch to the Baron , recommending it to his Excellency's particular attention said the Plenipotentiary eagerly exclaimed the Baron , and tore open the epistle and the diplomatist , overcome , leant back in his chair exclaimed the Chevalier , who hated German music with all his heart , and was now humming an air from La Dame Blanche
