# text = When the soldier was a little cooled , the conjuror again came forward , and , having moved his small magical table to a corner , and lit two tapers , one of which he placed at each side of the stage , he stripped off his hussar jacket , and began to imitate a monkey ; an animal which , by the faint light , in his singular costume , he very much resembled .
