# text = The applause was continued ; and the one-eyed Bohemian serjeant , delighted at the ridicule which was heaped on his military rival , actually threw the mimic some groschen said the conjuror and here the immense mouth of the actor seemed distended even a hundred degrees bigger , while with gloating eyes and extended arms he again set to at the half-emptied wafila basket of the unhappy pastry-cook growled the Austrian soldier retorted the glutton , with his mouth full and the soldier sprang at the conjuror cried Vivian Grey ; for the mob , frightened at the soldier , gave way cried the conjuror and so saying , with a dexterous spring the conjuror leaped over the heads of two or three staring children , and lighted on the nape of the serjeant's gigantic neck ; placing his forefingers behind each of the soldier's ears , he threatened to slit them immediately if he were not quiet .
