# text = He saw the student was a rapid drinker ; and , although he did not like to hurry his own enjoyment , he thought it most prudent to keep his glass well stored by his side exclaimed a man , entering the room rapidly as he spoke ; and , deliberately walking up to the table , he pushed between two of the cloth-merchants , who quietly made way ; and then placing a small square box before him , immediately opened it , and sweeping aside the dishes and glasses which surrounded him , began to fill their places with cups , balls , rings , and other mysterious-looking matters , which generally accompany a conjuror Here most of the company good-naturedly laughed at a trick which had amused them before a hundred times .
