# text = The restaurateur of Ems , in collusion with the official agent of the Duke of Nassau , were fortunate this season in having the Grand Duke knocked down to them asked the Grand Duke The Grand Duke continued by the side of Lady Madeleine for about twenty minutes , seizing every opportunity of uttering , in the most courtly tone , inane compliments ; and then trusting that he might soon have her Ladyship's opinion respecting the Austrian troop at the New House , and that Von Konigstein and his English friend would not delay letting him see them there , his Imperial Highness , followed by his silent suite , left the gardens said the Baron , occupying immediately the Grand Duke's vacated side said Lady Madeleine Some strange thoughts occurred to Vivian while this conversation was taking place inquired the Baron , with an air of great deference said the Baron , with an effort said Lady Madeleine , firmly ; for it seemed that the Baron required a little assistance at the end of his sentence returned his Excellency , with great rapidity of utterance Lady Madeleine , as if it could now no longer be postponed , introduced to the two gentlemen her brother , Mr . St . George .
# sent_id = 1214
