# text = This gentleman , who , during the whole previous conversation , had kept his head in a horizontal position , looking neither to the right nor to the left , and apparently unconscious that any one was conversing with his sister , because , according to the English custom , he was not introduced , now suddenly turned around , and welcomed his acquaintance with cordiality asked her Ladyship The Baron had resigned his place by Lady Madeleine , and was already in close conversation with Mr . St . George , from whose arm Lady Madeleine's was disengaged .
