# text = In a few minutes the Grand Duke , bowing to his circle , made a move , and regained the side of a Saxon lady , from whose interesting company he had been disturbed by the arrival of Prince Salvinski ; an individual of whose long stories and dull romances the Grand Duke had , from experience , a particular dread : but his Highness was always very courteous to the Poles So saying , the Baron reached the table exclaimed many voices as he came up asked the Baron , calmly quickly rattled a little thin man in spectacles , pointing at the same time to his unparalleled line of punctures .
