# text = Conversation seemed nearly extinct , and yet neither offered to turn back exclaimed Vivian , when , on accidentally turning to his companion , he found she was in tears and , sighing , she seemed suddenly to recover the words died on Vivian's lips , yet a power he could not withstand urged him to speak almost shrieked Miss Fane said Vivian She answered not , but holding down her head , covered her face with her small white hand ; her lovely face which was crimsoned with her flashing blood .
