# text = The Baron introduced a bottle of the only red wine that the Rhine boasts ; but which , for its fragrant and fruity flavour and its brilliant tint , is perhaps not inferior to the sunset glow of Burgundy continued the Grand Duke Vivian had submitted to the introductory ceremonies with the good grace which becomes a man of the world ; but the coolness of this last observation recalled our hero's wandering senses ; and , at the same time , alarmed at discovering that eight bottles of wine had been discussed by the party merely as preliminary , and emboldened by the contents of one bottle which had fallen to his own share , he had the courage to confront the Grand Duke of Johannisberger in his own castle shrieked all present , each with his right arm stretched out , glass in hand answered Vivian
