# text = The door would have been shut in his face had not he darted into the house before the woman was aware So saying , Essper , in a careless manner , tossed a broad piece in the air , and made it ring on a fellow coin , as he caught it in the palm of his hand when it descended asked the woman said the woman , pointing to a bench , and throwing a sour black loaf upon the table said Essper , wiping the bench with great care Something like a smile lit up the face of the sullen woman when she said bawled Essper after her , as she left the room So saying , Essper took them out of her hand and placed them before Vivian said the dame , her stern features relaxing into a smile ; and while she spoke she advanced to the great closet , Essper George following her , walking on his toes , lolling out his enormous tongue , and stroking his mock paunch .
