# text = Few minutes had elapsed ere Vivian perceived that his Highness was always served on bended knee ; surprised at this custom , which even the mightiest and most despotic monarchs seldom exact , and still more surprised at the contrast which all this state afforded to the natural ease and affable amiability of the Prince , Vivian ventured to ask his neighbour Arnelm whether the banquet of to-day was in celebration of any particular event of general or individual interest said the Jagd Junker
