# text = He turned from the comparison with feelings of sickening disgust , and it was with difficulty that his countenance could assume the due degree of hilarity which befitted the present occasion said the Prince said the Prince , turning to Mr . Grey Vivian acceded to the Prince's proposition with eagerness ; and accompanied by Prince Maximilian , and preceded by the little steward , who , surrounded by his serving-men , very much resembled a planet eclipsed by his satellites , they left the hall said the Prince , as he drew a large green velvet curtain from the windows of the cabinet said Vivian said the Prince of Little Lilliput , in a voice of deep melancholy ; and he hastily redrew the curtain .
