# text = In about twelve hours' time he was scolding Essper George for having presumed to wake him so early , quite unconscious that he had enjoyed anything more than a twenty minutes' doze Vivian read the note , which supposed that , of course , he would not wish to join the chase this morning , and regretted that the writer was obliged to ride out for a few hours to visit a neighbouring nobleman , but requested the pleasure of his guest's company at a private dinner in the cabinet on his return .
