# text = During dinner , which he hastily despatched , it did not escape our hero's attention that his Highness was unusually silent , and , indeed , agitated at length said the Prince Since the explanation of last night , the Prince , in private conversation , had dropped his regal plural said Vivian Though the Prince said this with an appearance of perfect sincerity , he stopped and looked earnest in his guest's face , as if he would read his secret thoughts , or were desirous of now giving him an opportunity of answering answered Vivian replied the Prince thought Vivian ; and he watched earnestly the countenance of the Prince .
