# text = These new visitors were a crowd of piping bullfinches , Virginia nightingales , trained canaries , Java sparrows , and Indian lorys ; which , freed from their cages of golden wire by their fond master , had fled , as was their custom , from his superb aviary to pay their respects and compliments at his daily levee said Beckendorff to Vivian ; for our hero , good-naturedly humouring the tastes of his host , was impartially dividing the luxuries of a peach among a crowd of gaudy and greedy little sparrows continued Beckendorff ; and tapping rather loudly on the table , he held out the forefinger of each hand .
