# text = The impressiveness of Vivian's manner produced a proper effect ; and except that he spoke somewhat affectedly slow and ridiculously precise , Essper George delivered himself with great clearness said the Prince said Vivian Here Essper George threw himself at Vivian's feet , and entreated him to quit the house immediately ejaculated the Prince ; and then he conversed with Vivian for some time in a whisper at length Vivian said Suppose " ( here he imitated Beckendorff said the Prince , when the door was at length shut continued Vivian , with a significant voice and marked emphasis The Prince of Little Lilliput was very disinclined to part with his shrewd counsellor , who had already done him considerable service , and he strongly opposed Vivian's proposition .
