# text = The approach of his Royal Highness extricated Vivian from an argument which was as profound as it was interminable ; and as Mr . Beckendorff retired with the Grand Duke into a recess in the ball-room , Vivian was requested by von Neuwied to attend his Excellency the Grand Marshal said the Prince continued his Excellency , with a knowing look continued his Excellency , with a look of great regret After an introductory speech in his Excellency's happiest manner , and in which an eulogium of Vivian and a compliment to the fair unknown got almost as completely entangled as the origin of slavery and the history of the feudal system in his more celebrated harangue , Vivian found himself waltzing with the anonymous beauty .
