# text = Most probably , on her first introduction to her future husband , all the romantic plans of the young Archduchess to excite an involuntary interest in his heart vanished ; but how this may be , it is needless for us to inquire , for that same night introduced another character into her romance for whom she was perfectly unprepared , and whose appearance totally disorganised its plot .
