# text = This adroit introduction of the red cabbage and cream settled everything ; when men are wearied and famished they have no inclination to be incredulous , and in a few moments Vivian was informed by his servant that the promised accommodation was satisfactory ; and having locked up the carriage , and wheeled it into a small outhouse , he and Essper were ushered by their host into a room which , as is usual in small German inns in the South , served at the same time both for kitchen and saloon .
